{"ex-3B05-1":{"id":"ex-3B05-1","chapter":"3B05","number":1,"title":"水波槽中的波動圖形","question":"<p>右圖顯示水波槽中的波動圖形，水波槽的水深恆定不變。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點是點振動源的位置。</p><p>(a) 繪畫箭號顯示水波在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的傳播方向。</p><p>(b) 振動源以 6 Hz 振動。求水波的速率。</p><p>(c) 如果振動源以兩倍的頻率振動，水波的速率和波長會怎樣改變？試簡單解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/80336f3a13070f297482e874.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:199.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a)</p><p>(b) 波長 λ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{8}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4 cm = 0.04 m</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span>λ = 6 × 0.04 = 0.24 m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) 由於水深不變，水波的速率也不變。</p><p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span>λ ，波速率恆定且 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 變成兩倍時，λ 會減半。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/0c1a2e1fc7c155ac48351c0c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:280.7px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[47.0001,53.49989511718752,557.6491,236.81610107421875],"text":"例 題 1 水波槽中的波動圖形\r\n右圖顯示水波槽中的波動圖形，水波槽的水深恆定不變。\r\nS 點是點振動源的位置。\r\n(a) 繪畫箭號顯示水波在 R 點的傳播方向。\r\n(b) 振動源以 6 Hz 振動。求水波的速率。\r\n(c) 如果振動源以兩倍的頻率振動，水波的速率和波長會\r\n怎樣改變？試簡單解釋。\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[47.0001,236.81610107421875,557.6491,515.3278951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) \r\nP\r\nR\r\nS\r\nQ 傳播方向\r\n(b) 波長 λ = 8\r\n2\r\n = 4 cm = 0.04 m\r\nv = fλ = 6 × 0.04 = 0.24 m s–1\r\n(c) 由於水深不變，水波的速率也不變。\r\n根據 v = fλ，波速率恆定且 f 變成兩倍時，λ 會減半。\r\nP\r\nR\r\nS\r\nQ\r\n8 cm\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B05-2":{"id":"ex-3B05-2","chapter":"3B05","number":2,"title":"進入深水區的波","question":"<p>如圖所示，直線波從淺水區進入深水區。</p><p>(a) 波在深水區中會傳播得較快還是較慢？</p><p>(b) 繪畫深水區的波動圖形。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/2dcc764fa00c74afe626f751.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:253.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 較快</p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/ac5987d78f42f70684315f36.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:253.4px\"></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,173.56989511718746,562.4491,334.8860778808594],"text":"例 題 2 進入深水區的波\r\n如圖所示，直線波從淺水區進入深\r\n水區。\r\n(a) 波在深水區中會傳播得較快還\r\n是較慢？\r\n(b) 繪畫深水區的波動圖形。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,334.8860778808594,562.4491,503.0258951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 較快\r\n(b)\r\n深水區 淺水區\r\n深水區 淺水區\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B05-3":{"id":"ex-3B05-3","chapter":"3B05","number":3,"title":"波的折射","question":"<p>如圖所示，直線波由 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 區傳播至<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 區。</p><p>(a) 波越過邊界時，</p><p>(i) 頻率怎樣改變？</p><p>(ii) 會偏向還是偏離法線？</p><p>(b) 哪一區的水較深？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/dec50dd4e6cb7ccd2158326b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:270.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) (i) 頻率不會改變。</p><p>(ii) 波偏向法線。</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 區</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":15,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,430.5318951171875,562.4491,619.8479919433594],"text":"例 題 3 波的折射\r\n如圖所示，直線波由 A 區傳播至\r\nB 區。\r\n(a) 波越過邊界時，\r\n (i) 頻率怎樣改變？\r\n (ii) 會偏向還是偏離法線？\r\n(b) 哪一區的水較深？\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,619.8479919433594,562.4491,730.1838951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) (i) 頻率不會改變。\r\n (ii) 波偏向法線。\r\n(b) A 區\r\nA 區 B 區\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B05-4":{"id":"ex-3B05-4","chapter":"3B05","number":4,"title":"斯涅耳定律","question":"<p>如圖所示，直線波由區域 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 進入區域<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span>。入射角是 30°，折射角是 20°。</p><p>(a) 求區域 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中水波的波長 λ<sub>X</sub>。</p><p>(b) 如果區域 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的水深減小，折射角怎樣改變？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/1539d4d824840a8dfde28883.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:212.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) λ<sub>Y</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{15}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5 cm</p><p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin θ_{1}}{sin θ_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{λ_{1}}{λ_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin 30°}{sin 20°}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{λ_{X}}{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>λ<sub>X</sub> = 7.31 cm</p><p>(b) 減小</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>i</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>θ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>i</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>θ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>，</p><p>Y 區的水深 ↓</p><p>⇒ v<sub>Y</sub> ↓ ⇒ sin θ<sub>Y</sub> ↓ ⇒ θ<sub>Y</sub> ↓</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":18,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718741,557.4491,214.81610107421875],"text":"例 題 4 斯涅耳定律\r\n如圖所示，直線波由區域 X 進入區域\r\nY。入射角是 30°，折射角是 20°。\r\n(a) 求區域 X 中水波的波長 λ X。\r\n(b) 如果區域 Y 的水深減小，折射角\r\n怎樣改變？\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,214.81610107421875,557.4491,399.8528951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) λ Y = 15\r\n3\r\n = 5 cm\r\n根據 sin θ 1\r\nsin θ 2\r\n = λ 1\r\nλ 2\r\n，\r\nsin 30°\r\nsin 20° = λ X\r\n5\r\nλ X = 7.31 cm\r\n(b) 減小\r\n15 cm\r\n30° 20°\r\n區域 X 區域 Y\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718741,176.4491,399.8528951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n根據 sin θ X\r\nsin θ Y\r\n = vX\r\nvY\r\n，\r\n區域 Y 的水深 ↓\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B05-5":{"id":"ex-3B05-5","chapter":"3B05","number":5,"title":"判斷干涉類型","question":"<p>下圖顯示位於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的兩個點振動源。它們以同相振動，在水波槽中產生兩列波長為 4 cm 的圓形波。</p><p>R</p><p>31 cm 19 cm</p><p>P Q</p><p>(a) 判斷在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點發生的干涉類型。</p><p>(b) 如果水波的波長增加至原來的兩倍，在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點所發生的干涉類型會有甚麽改變？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/9afea0714946e0923bec4bfc.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:280.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的程差 = 31 – 19 = 12 cm = 3λ</p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點會發生相長干涉。</p><p>(b) 新的波長 = 2 × 4 = 8 cm</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的程差 = 12 cm = 1.5λ ∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點會發生相消干涉。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":31,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,315.50189511718753,562.6491,594.8981018066406],"text":"例 題 5 判斷干涉類型\r\n下圖顯示位於 P 點和 Q 點的兩個點振動源。它們以同相振動，在水\r\n波槽中產生兩列波長為 4 cm 的圓形波。\r\nR\r\nP Q \r\n31 cm\r\n19 cm\r\n(a) 判斷在 R 點發生的干涉類型。\r\n(b) 如果水波的波長增加至原來的兩倍，在 R 點所發生的干涉類型會\r\n有甚麽改變？\r\n"},{"page":31,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,594.8981018066406,562.6491,743.4348951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) R 點的程差 = 31 – 19 = 12 cm = 3λ\r\n∴ R 點會發生相長干涉。\r\n(b) 新的波長 = 2 × 4 = 8 cm\r\nR 點的程差 = 12 cm = 1.5λ\r\n∴ R 點會發生相消干涉。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B05-6":{"id":"ex-3B05-6","chapter":"3B05","number":6,"title":"干涉圖形","question":"<p>圖中的兩個波源 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 振動同相，產生波長為λ 的水波。紫色線和綠色線都代表波峯。</p><p>(a) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的程差，答案以 λ 表示。</p><p>(b) 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點發生哪一種干涉？</p><p>(c) 如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 15 cm，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 11 cm，求 λ。</p><p>(d) 描述在圖示的一刻，在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的粒子的運動。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5621c7ecec4b0859762af2a0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:152.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的程差 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的程差 = 5λ – 3λ = 2λ</p><p>(b) 相長干涉</p><p>(c) Δ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> − <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>2λ = 15 − 11</p><p>λ = 2 cm</p><p>(d) 粒子瞬時靜止。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>P 和 Q 位於同一條腹線上，因此兩者的 Δ 相同。</p><p>提示</p><p>它在這一刻位於波峰。在一個周期內，它會向下移至波谷，然後回到波峰。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":33,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,392.7348951171875,562.4491,583.0509948730469],"text":"例 題 6 干涉圖形\r\n圖中的兩個波源 S1 和 S2 振動同相，產生波長為\r\nλ 的水波。紫色線和綠色線都代表波峯。\r\n(a) 求 P 點和 Q 點的程差，答案以 λ 表示。\r\n(b) 在 Q 點發生哪一種干涉？\r\n(c) 如果 S1Q = 15 cm，S2Q = 11 cm，求 λ。\r\n(d) 描述在圖示的一刻，在 P 點的粒子的運動。\r\n"},{"page":33,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,583.0509948730469,562.4491,741.5878951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) Q 點的程差 = P 點的程差 = 5λ – 3λ = 2λ\r\n(b) 相長干涉\r\n(c) Δ = S1Q − S2Q\r\n 2λ = 15 − 11 \r\n λ = 2 cm\r\n(d) 粒子瞬時靜止。\r\nS1\r\nP Q\r\nS2\r\nλ\r\n"},{"page":33,"kind":"tips","box":[40,388.7348951171875,181.4491,741.5878951171875],"text":"影片\r\n提提你\r\nP 點和 Q 點在同一腹線上，\r\n所以它們的 Δ 相同。\r\n提提你\r\n粒子在這一刻位於波峯，然\r\n後會在一個週期內向下移動\r\n至波谷，再向上返回波峯。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B05-7":{"id":"ex-3B05-7","chapter":"3B05","number":7,"title":"干涉與振動","question":"<p>兩個振動同相的點振動源 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 產生波長為 2 cm 的水波（圖 a）。</p><p>綠色線代表波峯，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的垂直平分線。沿 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XY</annotation></semantics></math></span> 線上，有些位置水的粒子會以最大振幅振動，在另一些位置水的粒子則保持靜止。</p><p>來自 S<sub>2</sub> 的波B C s / cm X Y</p><p>1 t –1</p><p>S<sub>1</sub> A S<sub>2</sub> 來自 S<sub>1</sub> 的波圖 a 圖 b</p><p>(a) 解釋為甚麼在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點水的粒子會以最大振幅振動。</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點是自 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點起第二個水保持靜止的位置，求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的程差（以 cm 為單位）。</p><p>(c) 草繪沿 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 線上水波振幅的變化。</p><p>(d) 圖 b 顯示 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XY</annotation></semantics></math></span> 線上某一點對應每列波的位移 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> 怎樣隨時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> 變化。</p><p>兩列波到達這一點時是否同相？</p><p>(e) 如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的振動反相，水的粒子在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點會以最大振幅振動還是保持靜止？試解釋答案。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/a153687b3983044e1fbbe3b2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:515.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的程差是 0，所以會發生相長干涉。</p><p>(b) 程差 Δ = 1.5λ = 1.5(2) = 3 cm</p><p>(c)</p><p>(d) 不是</p><p>(e) 來自 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的波到達 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點時必定是反相的。</p><p>∴ 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點必定出現相消干涉。</p><p>∴ 水的粒子會保持靜止。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/ad13f9fe42ad736a43b22f10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:270.9px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>對第一個極小值，Δ = 0.5λ</p><p>對第二個極小值，Δ = 1.5λ</p><p>提示</p><p>圓形波的振幅隨離開波源的距離增加而逐漸減小。</p><p>提示</p><p>兩列波的波峰並非同時到達。</p><p>提示</p><p>極大值會變為極小值，反之亦然。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":36,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,53.49989511718752,557.6491,456.2662658691406],"text":"例 題 7 干涉與振動\r\n兩個振動同相的點振動源 S1 和 S2 產生波長為 2 cm 的水波（圖 a）。\r\n綠色線代表波峯，AB 是 S1S2 的垂直平分線。沿 XY 線上，有些位置\r\n水的粒子會以最大振幅振動，在另一些位置水的粒子則保持靜止。\r\nX Y\r\nB\r\nA\r\nC\r\nS1 S2\r\n圖 a\r\n–1\r\n1\r\nt\r\ns / cm\r\n來自 S1 的波\r\n來自 S2 的波\r\n圖 b\r\n(a) 解釋為甚麼在 B 點水的粒子會以最大振幅振動。\r\n(b) C 點是自 B 點起第二個水保持靜止的位置，求 C 點的程差（以 cm\r\n為單位）。\r\n(c) 草繪沿 AB 線上水波振幅的變化。\r\n(d) 圖 b 顯示 XY 線上某一點對應每列波的位移 s 怎樣隨時間 t 變化。\r\n兩列波到達這一點時是否同相？\r\n(e) 如果 S1和 S2的振動反相，水的粒子在 B 點會以最大振幅振動還是\r\n保持靜止？試解釋答案。\r\n"},{"page":36,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,456.2662658691406,557.6491,750.4058951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) B 點的程差是 0，所以會發生相長干涉。\r\n(b) 程差 Δ = 1.5λ = 1.5(2) = 3 cm\r\n(c)\r\nA B\r\n振幅\r\n距離\r\n(d) 不是\r\n(e) 來自 S1 和 S2 的波到達 B 點時必定是反相的。\r\n∴ 在 B 點必定出現相消干涉。\r\n∴ 水的粒子會保持靜止。\r\n單元練習5.3 Q6 (p.75)\r\n"},{"page":36,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718752,176.6491,750.4058951171875],"text":"反相的振動源是相干的。\r\n提提你\r\n第一個靜止的位置：\r\nΔ = 0.5λ\r\n第二個靜止的位置：\r\nΔ = 1.5λ\r\n提提你\r\n離波源愈遠，圓形波的振幅\r\n愈小。\r\n提提你\r\n兩列波的波峯並非同時到\r\n達。\r\n提提你\r\n水的粒子以最大振幅振動的\r\n位置和水的粒子保持靜止的\r\n位置會互換。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B05-8":{"id":"ex-3B05-8","chapter":"3B05","number":8,"title":"波長、頻率和波圈的數目","question":"<p>一名學生在彈性繩上產生分別有 1、2 和 3 個波腹的駐波，如圖所示。波沿繩傳播的速率為 10.8 m s<sup>−1</sup>。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/d7a6298b8064d597d3fcc4d6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:566.4px\"></p><p>求每列波的波長及頻率，並由此提出波的頻率 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> 與波腹數目 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 之間的關係。</p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/7d26b8ed1039fd25651aafa7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:566.4px\"></p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>波腹數目（<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>）</p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>波長（<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math>）</p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>頻率（<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math>）。由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，</p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>因此，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math></p>","tips":"","think":"<p>你能否用繩長 L 及波腹數目 n 表示 λₙ？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>每個波腹的長度為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>。兩端固定時，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>，所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>。因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math>。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":45,"kind":"question","box":[52.0001,53.80989511718758,562.4491,231.8865966796875],"text":"例 題 8 波長、頻率和波圈的數目\r\n如圖所示，學生在彈性索上產生有一個、兩個和三個波圈的駐波。波在彈性索上的速率是\r\n10.8 m s–1。\r\n90 cm 90 cm 90 cm\r\n振動器 彈性索\r\n求各駐波的波長和頻率。據此，寫出駐波頻率 fn 與波圈數目 n 的關係。\r\n"},{"page":45,"kind":"answer","box":[52.0001,231.8865966796875,562.4491,493.9638951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n波 形\r\n––2\r\n1\r\n90 cm\r\nλ\r\n90 cm\r\n––2\r\nλ 2\r\n90 cm\r\n––2\r\nλ 3\r\n波圈數目 (n) n = 1 n = 2 n = 3\r\n波長 (λ n) λ 1\r\n2\r\n = 90 \r\nλ 1 = 180 cm\r\n2 × λ 2\r\n2\r\n = 90\r\nλ 2 = 90 cm\r\n3 × λ 3\r\n2\r\n = 90\r\nλ 3 = 60 cm\r\n頻率 ( fn)\r\n根據 v = fλ，\r\nf1 = v\r\nλ 1\r\n = 10.8\r\n1.8\r\n = 6 Hz f2 = v\r\nλ 2\r\n = 10.8\r\n0.9\r\n= 12 Hz (= 2f1)\r\nf3 = v\r\nλ 3\r\n = 10.8\r\n0.6\r\n= 18 Hz (= 3f1)\r\n因此，fn = nf1\r\n"},{"page":45,"kind":"answer","box":[49,482.9633951171875,565.4490000000001,552.7413951171875],"text":"想一想\r\n你可以用繩子的長度 L 和波圈的數目 n 來表示 λ n 嗎？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["answer","question","tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B05-9":{"id":"ex-3B05-9","chapter":"3B05","number":9,"title":"波上的粒子運動","question":"<p>右圖顯示繩子上的一列波在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 的情況。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是繩子上的粒子。在這一刻，粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 正向下移動。</p><p>(a) 繩子上的是行波還是駐波？</p><p>(b) 波的週期是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>，在同一幅圖上草繪粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 由 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的位移 — 時間關係線圖。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/2d5dbe5717fd4cf480aefc4c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:113.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 駐波</p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/75fb7201898d246977492ef8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:224.5px\"></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>如果這是行波，X 和 Z 會朝相反方向移動。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/54ab6938587699a717c983f6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:179.4px\"></p><p>提示</p><p>由於 X 在 t = 0 時向下移動，它並非位於最大位移處。</p><p>s<sub>X</sub> 小於振幅，而且正在減少。由於 Y 與 X 同相振動，其 s−t 圖的形狀相同，但振幅較大。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B05_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7d550cf0329734abb4366b515232dbfdab13de858faacd951edc349f61e2c73c","segments":[{"page":48,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,391.3188951171875,557.4491,562.6351928710938],"text":"例 題 9 波上的粒子運動\r\n右圖顯示繩子上的一列波在 t = 0 的情況。X、Y 和\r\nZ 是繩子上的粒子。在這一刻，粒子 X 和 Z 正向\r\n下移動。\r\n(a) 繩子上的是行波還是駐波？\r\n(b) 波的週期是 T，在同一幅圖上草繪粒子 X 和 Y 由 t = 0 至 t = T\r\n的位移—時間關係線圖。\r\n"},{"page":48,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,562.6351928710938,557.4491,742.7748951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 駐波\r\n(b)\r\n0\r\ns\r\nY\r\nX\r\nT\r\nt\r\n複習 5 Q29 (p.96)\r\nX\r\nZ\r\nY\r\n"},{"page":48,"kind":"tips","box":[40,387.3188951171875,176.4491,742.7748951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n如果繩子上的是行波，粒子\r\nX 和 Z 會向相反方向移動。\r\nX\r\nZ\r\n提提你\r\n由於粒子 X 在 t = 0時正向\r\n下移動，因此它並不是處於\r\n最大位移的位置。sX 比振\r\n幅小，而且正在減少。\r\n因為粒子 Y 和 X 的振動同\r\n相，所 以 粒 子 Y 的位移—\r\n時間關係線圖與粒子 X 的\r\n形狀相同，但振幅較大。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}